【来源1】{"claim": "Taking care of the bonsai tree motivates Evan to keep going through tough times.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-08-07T19:52:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: I got this because it symbolizes strength and resilience. Taking care of it motivates me to keep going through tough times.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源2】{"claim": "Evan struggled with his health a few years ago but stuck with it.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-27T10:52:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: [Image: a photo of a set of five cards with the words let it shine] That's great, Sam! I struggled with my health a few years ago, but stuck with it. Here's a reminder of my commitment - my gym membership card. It's not just about exercise, diet and lifestyle changes also play a big role.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源3】{"claim": "Evan's family motivates him to stay healthy and helps a lot with his health goals.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-08-07T19:52:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: [Image: a photo of a person's wrist with a smart watch on it] Thanks Sam! My family motivates me to stay healthy. Well, it helps a lot with my health goals. It tracks my progress really well and serves as a constant reminder to keep going.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源4】{"claim": "Evan says making fitness fun and finding little ways to make smarter diet choices really added up for him.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-24T19:11:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: Yeah, what worked for me was finding a fitness routine I really enjoy. It's my go-to, I love the feeling of being healthy and strong. Making it fun and finding little ways to make smarter choices in my diet really added up. Don't forget, you got this!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源5】{"claim": "Evan says that finding a fitness routine he really enjoys worked for him; it is his go-to and he loves the feeling of being healthy and strong.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-24T19:11:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: Yeah, what worked for me was finding a fitness routine I really enjoy. It's my go-to, I love the feeling of being healthy and strong. Making it fun and finding little ways to make smarter choices in my diet really added up. Don't forget, you got this!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源6】{"claim": "Evan advises finding something that motivates you and makes you happy, whether it's large or tiny, to help conquer struggles.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-08-07T19:52:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: [Image: a photo of a bonsai tree in a black vase on a wooden table] Yep, that's it. Find something that motivates you and makes you happy, whether it's large or tiny. It'll help us conquer the struggles we encounter.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源7】{"claim": "Evan believes diet and lifestyle changes, not just exercise, play a big role in health.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-27T10:52:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: [Image: a photo of a set of five cards with the words let it shine] That's great, Sam! I struggled with my health a few years ago, but stuck with it. Here's a reminder of my commitment - my gym membership card. It's not just about exercise, diet and lifestyle changes also play a big role.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源8】{"claim": "Evan has a gym membership card, which he treats as a reminder of his commitment.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-27T10:52:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: [Image: a photo of a set of five cards with the words let it shine] That's great, Sam! I struggled with my health a few years ago, but stuck with it. Here's a reminder of my commitment - my gym membership card. It's not just about exercise, diet and lifestyle changes also play a big role.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源9】{"claim": "Evan had a health scare last week: a sudden heart palpitation incident that shook him up and served as a wake-up call about his lifestyle.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-06T15:55:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: [Image: a photo of a person holding a bottle of medicine in their hand] Hey Sam! Long time no talk! How're you doing? Life's been quite the rollercoaster lately. I had a health scare last week – a sudden heart palpitation incident that really shook me up. It's been a serious wake-up call about my lifestyle.", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "last week", "start": "2023-05-29", "end_exclusive": "2023-06-05", "precision": "week", "rule": "iso_monday_week"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源10】{"claim": "Evan is being extra careful with his health lately, trying to eat less processed food and sugary snacks.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-06T15:55:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: That salad looks yummy! I'm being extra careful with my health lately. I'm trying to eat less processed food and sugary snacks, even though I love ginger snaps. Have you made any changes to your diet recently?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源11】{"claim": "Evan made dietary changes, including cutting down on sugary snacks and eating more vegetables and fruit, which had a big impact on his health.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-27T10:52:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: [Image: a photo of a table full of fresh produce and vegetables] I made some dietary changes, like cutting down on sugary snacks and eating more veggies and fruit, and it made a big impact on my health. Have you considered any changes?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源12】{"claim": "Evan: Take care, Sam! I'll catch up with you later.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "raw_fallback"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-24T19:11:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: Take care, Sam! I'll catch up with you later.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源13】{"claim": "Evan took his family on a road trip to Jasper last weekend (weekend before 2023-05-24).", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-24T19:11:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: [Image: a photo of a person holding a book in front of a lake] Hey Sam, good to hear from you! Since we last talked, lots has been happening! Last weekend, I took my family on a road trip to Jasper. It was amazing! We drove through the Icefields Parkway and the glaciers and lakes were gorgeous. I got a shot of a glacier, check it out!", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "Last weekend", "start": "2023-05-20", "end_exclusive": "2023-05-22", "precision": "weekend", "rule": "previous_iso_weekend"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源14】{"claim": "Evan met an awesome Canadian woman during his trip to Canada, and being with her makes him feel alive.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-08-07T19:52:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: [Image: a photography of a couple walking through the snow holding hands] Hey Sam, how's it going? Last week I went on a trip to Canada and something unreal happened - I met this awesome Canadian woman and it was like something out of a movie. She's incredible and being with her makes me feel alive.", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "Last week", "start": "2023-07-31", "end_exclusive": "2023-08-07", "precision": "week", "rule": "iso_monday_week"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源15】{"claim": "Evan says ginger snaps are his weakness.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-08-07T19:52:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: [Image: a photo of a woman and a child playing on a swing set] Ginger snaps are my weakness for sure! Dealing with health issues has been tough, but it's made me appreciate the good moments more. These are the ones who bring lots of joy even through the hard times.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源16】{"claim": "Evan has been working on his health for two years as of 2023-08-07.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-08-07T19:52:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: [Image: a photo of a box with a fitness watch on it] Yes, they bring me such joy. My healthy road has been a long one. I've been working on it for two years now, so there have been ups and downs, but I'm doing my best.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源17】{"claim": "Evan offers to be available if Sam needs him and encourages Sam to keep going.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-27T10:52:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: No worries, Sam. I'm here if you need me. Keep going!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
